/* index1-5 · 最後一段 3D LOGO 的專用參數面板 (2026-10-24). Client: 「最後一cut的3D LOGO 要開數值bar給我」.
   The same dials the big tuner has under 「LOGO 收尾 Logo Seal」 (CONFIG.logoSeal / logoMark / logoLake), but only the ones that
   shape the 3D mark, in one small panel that is right there at the last cut instead of 64 groups down.
   · Starts closed, including LOGO preview links. M toggles; × closes. Scrolling never opens it automatically.
     Available on localhost or with an explicit ?logopanel flag; ?logopanel=0 keeps the M shortcut available.
   · Material/pose writes straight into CONFIG. Shape dials update a memory-only preview;「精細套用」saves the Blender asset.
   · Values you move are kept in localStorage (only where the panel exists) and re-applied on load. 複製參數 copies just what differs from
     the defaults as JSON { logoSeal, logoMark, logoLake } — paste it back to the developer and it becomes the new default.
   · Double-click a row's name to put that row back. 全部還原 puts everything back and forgets the stored values.
   Built into the page by prototypes/index1-5/logo-panel-build.cjs (which also embeds the row list, read from the live modules). */

// A separate preset key preserves previous saved settings without applying them to the new dusk look.
const STORE = 'finnovation-index1-5-logo-panel-v2-dusk';
